gate\n- 0.2s for sequence interpolation\n- 2s for creation with max_stable_time\n- Final evaluation time: 1500 seconds\n\n**6. Validation and Contract**\nAll sequences must:\n- Have at least 25% zeros to reduce peak impact\n- Maintain smooth convolution structure\n- Pass 6-step gradient checks in separate validation phase",
